                desc = "Three methods for selecting bits in the command ID as the mapping index when the command ID is used to map the priority id_map_idx[11:8]: Any one bit in the lower 16 bits of the command ID is selected as idx[2]. id_map_idx[7:4]: Any one bit in the lower 16 bits of the command ID is selected as idx[1]. id_map_idx[3:0]: Any one bit in the lower 16 bits of the command ID is selected as idx[0]. For example, if id_map_idx is set to 0x3A0, ID[3], ID[10], and ID[0] of the command form idx[2:0], which is used to map the command priority from the priority lookup table. The lookup table indicates the description of AXI_QOS_WRPRI or AXI_QOS_RDPRI.";
